  "theory": "<h3>📌 Числительные 0–20</h3><table border='1' cellpadding='8' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Число</th><th>Немецкий</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>0</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>null</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>1</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>eins</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>2</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>zwei</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>3</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>drei</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>4</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>vier</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>5</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>fünf</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>6</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>sechs</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>7</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>sieben</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>8</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>acht</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>9</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>neun</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>10</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>zehn</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>11</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>elf</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>12</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>zwölf</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>20</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>zwanzig</span></td></tr></table><h3>📌 Числительные 21–100</h3><p><strong>Правило:</strong> единицы + und + десятки</p><ul><li>21 — <span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>einundzwanzig</span></li><li>30 — <span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>dreißig</span></li><li>100 — <span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>hundert</span></li></ul><h3>📌 Страны и языки</h3><table border='1' cellpadding='10' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Страна</th><th>Язык</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Deutschland</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Deutsch</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Russland</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Russisch</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>die Türkei</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Türkisch</span></td></tr></table><h3>📌 Глаголы wohnen и kommen</h3><table border='1' cellpadding='10' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Местоимение</th><th>wohnen</th><th>kommen</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>ich</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>wohne</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>komme</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>du</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>wohnst</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>kommst</span></td></tr></table><div class='info-box' style='background: #E8F0FE; padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px;'><strong>🎯 ВАЖНО!</strong><br>После <strong>woher</strong> → предлог <strong>aus</strong>: Ich komme <strong>aus</strong> Russland.<br>После <strong>wo</strong> → предлог <strong>in</strong>: Ich wohne <strong>in</strong> Berlin.</div>",
